type: software
title: "comdare-cache-engine"
abstract: >-
  Active Cache-Aware Hardware Adaptation Cache Engine for Trie-Based Index Structures: a C++23
  framework that permutes search-algorithm, allocator, prefetch and hardware axes at compile time,
  builds the resulting tier binaries and measures them; Framework module of the diploma thesis of
  Benjamin-Elias Probst (Technische Universitaet Dresden, 2026).
authors:
